{"title":"2016 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96a8046e34f31b96bce4bd6dccb9fe8a2f0b4dae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1^{3} + 2^{3} + 3^{3}}{(1 + 2 + 3)^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"100\" height=\"45\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/8/b5853428e805f0b7693c7094da678541a938e85d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1^{3} + 2^{3} + 3^{3}}{(1 + 2 + 3)^{2}} = \\frac{1 + 8 + 27}{(3 + 3)^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"209\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/0/4a02c92986d361b95aa502fb638608eda0eb00c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{9 + 27}{6^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"75\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/9/9194ecdcfaedf022be2488f31b0f36fae4a2b81d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{36}{36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"43\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/f/1efb15efd57dc98ffdb84c465473552ad0f77fc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"41\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> natural cubes is always equal to the square of the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> natural numbers (i.e. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/0/e40713d8a744430f7964db5f52d5552f6fe8ad69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^{3} + 2^{3} + 3^{3} + \\cdots + (n - 1)^{3} + n^{3} = (1 + 2 + 3 + \\cdots + (n - 1) + n)^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"539\" height=\"21\" />). \n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/d/dcd4844275c3db6da9a4864c2bb6b099546f0ef7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1^{3} + 2^{3} + 3^{3}}{(1 + 2 + 3)^{2}} = \\frac{(1 + 2 + 3)^{2}}{(1 + 2 + 3)^{2}} = \\boxed{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"266\" height=\"45\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CSMC\" title=\"2016 CSMC\">2016 CSMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CSMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CSMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CSMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CSMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Senior_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Senior Competition\">CEMC Senior Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018033552\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.026 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 94/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1240/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 137/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1901/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   11.519      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n100.00%   11.519      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37232:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018033552 and revision id 287512. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}